{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Co-Ape: Rise Of The Monke</strong> is a climbing game where two players control a single monkey together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the game:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Two-Player Coordination:</strong> Players must work together, each controlling different mechanics to climb upwards. One player controls walking and running, while the other controls jumping and looking around.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Varied Platforms and Obstacles:</strong> Throughout the game, players will encounter shifting platforms, rotating obstacles, and slippery surfaces, adding to the challenge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A Unique Cooperative Experience:</strong> Perfect synchronization and communication are essential to overcome climbs that cannot be achieved alone.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Offline and Online Co-op:</strong> Players can team up and play together online or choose to play solo.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3600150?t=1742333499","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600150/36780179596ad7284a79e865a4a117add9d11591/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1742333499","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600150/94ab2c6ea24c911ecaea66d995916c9a34f2c5e9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742333499","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600150/94ab2c6ea24c911ecaea66d995916c9a34f2c5e9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742333499","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragra